td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">NE</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label/><p>NE=not examined. NE<sup>&#x0002a;</sup> the heterogeneity of the cellular component (size and shapes) does not permit any measurement.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn2"><label/><p>The proportion of epithelial cells labeled was estimated as per thousand (&#x02030;) of the total number of thyrocytes, and presented as mean values&#x000b1;s.e.m. For scoring, at least a thousand thyrocytes on two different slides were counted in one mouse thyroid.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>